title: "Reproducibility package: Temporal spinal transcriptomic reprogramming and stimulation-associated candidate genes in neuropathic pain"
abstract: >-
  Analysis scripts and intermediate result tables for a criterion-explicit
  cross-dataset re-analysis of four public spinal cord datasets
  (GSE175760, GSE5296, GSE243038, GSE189070), covering time-course
  differential expression with limma-trend, fuzzy c-means temporal clustering,
  weighted gene co-expression network analysis, machine-learning candidate
  prioritisation, GSVA/PROGENy pathway scoring, cross-platform concordance and
  cell-type expression annotation.
type: software
